# Design System (React Native)

## Tokens over magic values

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
import { getTheme, spacing, radius } from './src/theme';

const theme = getTheme(isDarkMode);
<View style={{ backgroundColor: theme.colors.surface, padding: spacing[4], borderRadius: radius.sm }}>

// ❌ BAD
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#f5f5f5', padding: 18, borderRadius: 14 }}>
```

## Key files

- `src/theme/tokens.ts` — primitives + `getTheme()`
- `DESIGN.md` — agent-readable token mirror (synced from loopops-web-app)
- `knowledge/design-system.md` — usage rules

## Primary color rule — MANDATORY

> **Primary action color is BLACK (filled-dark), not blue.**

- Primary buttons: `theme.colors.filledDark` bg + `theme.colors.filledDarkFg` text
- Brand blue (`#0431C0`): links, accents, focus — never primary CTAs

## Semantic colors (prefer these)

| Token | Use for |
| ----- | ------- |
| `surface` | Main backgrounds |
| `surfaceSub` | Secondary panels |
| `content` | Primary text |
| `contentSub` | Secondary text |
| `contentMuted` | Placeholders, captions |
| `accent` | Brand blue highlights |
| `filledDark` | Primary CTA buttons |
| `success` / `error` / `warning` | Status |

## Spacing and radius

4px grid: `spacing[1]` (4) through `spacing[8]` (32). Radius: `radius.xs` (8), `radius.sm` (16), `radius.md` (24), `radius.full` (999).

## Typography

- Headings: Funnel Display (load when custom fonts are added)
- Body: Public Sans / system default
- Scale: `fontSize.xs` (8) through `fontSize['4xl']` (32)

## Ask before

Adding new tokens, changing semantic colors, or introducing a UI library.
